#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7driver-intel.xml:124
msgid "Installation of Xorg Intel Driver"
msgstr "Instalação do Controlador Intel do <quote>Xorg</quote>"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7driver-intel.xml:137
msgid ""
"Install <application>Xorg Intel Driver</application> by running the "
"following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o <application>Controlador Intel do &quot;Xorg&quot;</application> "
"executando os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7driver-intel.xml:141
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<userinput>./autogen.sh $XORG_CONFIG     \\\n"
"            --enable-kms-only \\\n"
"            --enable-uxa      \\\n"
"            --mandir=/usr/share/man &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>./autogen.sh $XORG_CONFIG      \\\n"
"            --enable-kms-only \\\n"
"            --enable-uxa      \\\n"
"            --mandir=/usr/share/man &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7driver-intel.xml:148
msgid "This package does not come with a test suite."
msgstr "Esse pacote não vem com uma suíte de teste."

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7driver-intel.xml:152
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7driver-intel.xml:155
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<userinput>make install &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"mv -v /usr/share/man/man4/intel-virtual-output.4 \\\n"
"      /usr/share/man/man1/intel-virtual-output.1 &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"sed -i '/\\.TH/s/4/1/' /usr/share/man/man1/intel-virtual-output.1</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>make install &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"mv -v /usr/share/man/man4/intel-virtual-output.4 \\\n"
"       /usr/share/man/man1/intel-virtual-output.1 &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"sed -i '/\\.TH/s/4/1/' /usr/share/man/man1/intel-virtual-output.1</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7driver-intel.xml:165
msgid "Working around problems with the Intel driver"
msgstr "Solucionando problemas com o controlador Intel"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7driver-intel.xml:168
msgid ""
"The SandyBridge New Acceleration (SNA) code is intended to replace the old "
"UXA (UMA Acceleration Architecture), but it is a large body of code and may "
"cause problems.  However, the version of the code in the version control "
"system listed above has been tested successfully with both SNA and UXA "
"capabilities."
msgstr ""
"O código &quot;SandyBridge New Acceleration&quot; (&quot;SNA&quot;) destina-"
"se a substituir o antigo &quot;UMA Acceleration Architecture&quot; "
"(&quot;UXA&quot;), mas ele é um grande corpo de código e possivelmente cause"
" problemas. Entretanto, a versão do código no sistema de controle de versão "
"listado acima foi testada com êxito com ambos os recursos &quot;SNA&quot; e "
"&quot;UXA&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7driver-intel.xml:176
msgid ""
"To work around this problem, as well as enabling support for UXA, it is "
"necessary to force UXA to be used by creating a configuration file.  If this"
" problem applies to you, create the following file as the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user and modify it as needed:"
msgstr ""
"Para contornar esse problema, bem como habilitar o suporte para o "
"&quot;UXA&quot;, é necessário forçar que o &quot;UXA&quot; seja usado "
"criando-se um arquivo de configuração. Se esse problema se aplicar a você, "
"[então] crie o seguinte arquivo como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot; e modifique-o conforme "
"necessário:"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7driver-intel.xml:183
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt;&gt; /etc/X11/xorg.conf.d/20-intel.conf &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>Section   \"Device\"\n"
"        Identifier \"Intel Graphics\"\n"
"        Driver     \"intel\"\n"
"        #Option     \"DRI\" \"2\"            # DRI3 is default\n"
"        #Option     \"AccelMethod\"  \"sna\" # default\n"
"        #Option     \"AccelMethod\"  \"uxa\" # fallback\n"
"EndSection</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat &gt;&gt; /etc/X11/xorg.conf.d/20-intel.conf &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>Section   \"Device\"\n"
"        Identifier \"Intel Graphics\"\n"
"        Driver     \"intel\"\n"
"        #Option     \"DRI\" \"2\"            # DRI3 é o padrão\n"
"        #Option     \"AccelMethod\"  \"sna\" # padrão\n"
"        #Option     \"AccelMethod\"  \"uxa\" # substituto\n"
"EndSection</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7driver-intel.xml:196
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações dos Comandos"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7driver-intel.xml:199
msgid ""
"<parameter>--enable-kms-only</parameter>: This switch omits the UMS (User "
"Mode Setting) code."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--enable-kms-only</parameter>: Essa chave omite o código "
"&quot;User Mode Setting&quot; (&quot;UMS&quot;)."

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7driver-intel.xml:204
msgid ""
"<parameter>--enable-uxa</parameter>: This switch allows the old UXA code to "
"be compiled in addition to the default SNA."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--enable-uxa</parameter>: Essa chave permite que o antigo código "
"&quot;UXA&quot; seja compilado além do padrão &quot;SNA&quot;."

